reviews.text:
I think I escaped the room about seven times, but escaped twice.
I couldn't escape the room again today ㅠㅠ I guess difficulty level 2 is my level hahaha. The young male staff member was friendly (if he's younger than me, he's young).
I played Dream Invaders, but I used less hints in the beginning due to my pride, so I ran out of time. Thank you for getting me out of the room;;;
